  rw_cells asegs m1 (bv_unsigned sp + -64) [CB 24 j24; C8 s3v; C8 s2v; C8 s1v; C8 s0v; C8 ra] ->
  stk asegs m1 lo (bv_unsigned sp + -64) -> lo + IB_STACK <= bv_unsigned sp -> aceil <= lo ->
